</section>

<section>
    <h2>A Letter From Kojo 💌</h2>

    <div class="card">
        Dear Portia,

        <br><br>

        I may not always have the perfect words,
        but I want you to know that I appreciate you.
        Having you in my life is something I don't take for granted.

        <br><br>

        I hope this new chapter brings you closer to
        your dreams and gives you countless reasons to be happy.

        <br><br>

        Keep being the wonderful person you are.
        Never stop believing in yourself.

        <br><br>

        Happy Birthday, Portia.

        <br><br>

        With love,<br>
        <strong>Kojo ❤️</strong>
    </div>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Even Across The Distance 🌍</h2>

    <div class="card">
        Distance may keep us in different places,
